@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Smart Traffic Management System)

[*] --> MonitoringTraffic

state MonitoringTraffic <<choice>>
MonitoringTraffic --> ControlStreetLights : [Pedestrians waiting]
MonitoringTraffic --> ManageSignals : [Vehicles on road]

state ControlStreetLights <<choice>>
ControlStreetLights --> CaptureVehicleDetails
@enduml
